+/* Wrap a post-program xdp_buff in an skb over the same buffer.
+ *
+ * data and data_end are read back from the xdp_buff rather than from the
+ * original length, because bpf_xdp_adjust_head() and bpf_xdp_adjust_tail()
+ * may have moved either. That is what the headroom is for.
